g", "id": "1425302495524377", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619113_1425302502191043_3530411803686966872_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MExGpE9s7DcQ7kNvwHUcoWH&_nc_oc=AdopHPfp8GkjakMwtRNeTHZ5R2hCC-bkVlhxhXaYBAMGcY1r3hhZecNVVMDQA0uyIf0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMW6HPx-IfDIbzKUs88UXchdKcQY9LBYVf0FRSv5u8qng&oe=6ABFCE69"}, {"file_name": "GrupoEloEditorialVR_SC4.png", "id": "1484534162573361", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_1484534165906694_6555697432927181120_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sMIipZVS6TcQ7kNvwGdFttt&_nc_oc=AdpEF1Ugh28S_oUSuu7-JBwEVWyL3HqnnBe8K14tsAP-7MhjDkz6MylO3fpZmUmrbzE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPRE6BPln4sPQB2FFp-24eqz1eANkh6aZaCL0SbU2zNTQ&oe=6ABFC52E"}, {"file_name": "GrupoEloEditorialVR__SC1.png", "id": "2742688489261149", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619836_2742688492594482_7564626089039613063_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mywHp6L8jbQQ7kNvwGv8Aj0&_nc_oc=AdqqsZbiEnYePkDIyZgGsxtKqh5xpVNIcjHiElCqsXoFsQKDk4jJCVLRiUmysVIHDaY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOkdpEhiIFJNxbvadQbE1QwRl3JAgnizrc9jrDQGvJG3A&oe=6ABFB08F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GrupoEloEditorialVR_CoverLandscape.png", "id": "1809805453283406", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617775_1809805456616739_3873431148251973225_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0_E4yRYZkLEQ7kNvwGqbBPW&_nc_oc=AdogxjA-3CpWNaUJfSFXr_M1U5hcz09ujRlihfJD0bwSAbBoPLPzxbkeUC5Z-UcS5Ic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMH6O4StcmpWB52GPVHr5byXeYHa0EOlOgaWoPEa_629Q&oe=6ABFB75D"}, "display_name": "Grupo Elo Editorial VR", "keywords": ["Educa\u00e7\u00e3o", "Literatura", "Livros", "Hist\u00f3ria", "Narrativa"], "long_description": "Descubra uma nova forma de viver hist\u00f3rias com Grupo Elo Editorial VR, a experi\u00eancia de realidade virtual transforma livros em aventuras m\u00e1gicas.\n\nNo nosso Universo Imersivo VR, voc\u00ea encontra prateleiras repletas de livros interativos. Com os controles ou suas m\u00e3os, escolha e entre no t\u00edtulo: voc\u00ea \u00e9 transportado para dentro da hist\u00f3ria, onde o autor do livro aparecer\u00e1 diante de voc\u00ea para convid\u00e1-lo \u00e0 obra. A tecnologia \u00e9 a nossa maior aliada em promover o desejo pela leitura.\n\nAssista a cenas animadas em 3D com os personagens ganhando vida, falando, se movimentando e interagindo no cen\u00e1rio ao seu redor. \u00c9 como estar dentro do ambiente do livro e fazer parte da hist\u00f3ria.\n\nIdeal para pais e filhos, professores e todos que desejam incentivar a leitura de forma divertida e inovadora. Grupo Elo Editorial VR une literatura, imagina\u00e7\u00e3o e tecnologia para criar momentos inesquec\u00edveis e ati\u00e7ar o gosto pelos livros.\n", "short_description": "Explore mundos ilustrados e a literatura em VR, conhe\u00e7a os autores e viva hist\u00f3rias de forma imersiva."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://eloeditora.com.br/politica-de-privacidade-vr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Grupo Elo Editorial", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://eloeditora.com.br/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["pt_BR"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "HAND_TRACKING"]